{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to $KTP_CASTER_CASTS (default caster/casts.json), OUTSIDE this repo, and fill it in.",
    "_consent is REQUIRED: caster_weekly.py refuses to download anything until it says who",
    "agreed to being transcribed and when. Recordings are transcribed once and deleted in the",
    "same step. One entry per cast. 'start' is the recording's start as a unix epoch.",
    "'matches' maps each match the cast covers to its map; a cast can cover more than one.",
    "A LIVE cast (started while the match was played) aligns at a fixed +60 s. A DELAYED cast",
    "(re-cast later from a recording) has no epoch relationship: set kind to 'delayed' and",
    "'anchor' to the MM:SS where the half-end score is read aloud. 'scan' writes stubs with",
    "empty matches; a human places them."
  ],
  "_consent": "<who agreed, and when>",
  "_channels": [
    "<channel url>",
    "<another channel url>"
  ],
  "<cast-id>": {
    "start": 1700000000,
    "kind": "live",
    "title": "<as listed>",
    "url": "<watch url>",
    "matches": {
      "<match-id>": "dod_<map>"
    }
  },
  "<another-cast-id>": {
    "start": 1700009999,
    "kind": "delayed",
    "anchor": "26:01",
    "title": "<as listed>",
    "url": "<watch url>",
    "matches": {
      "<match-id>": "dod_<map>",
      "<second-match-id>": "dod_<map>"
    }
  }
}
